+config FUSE_FEV_CACHE
+	bool "fev: cache what the file server's change events keep true"
+	depends on FUSE_FEV_NOTIFY
+	help
+	  What a client must do differently to cache for long what a server
+	  announces every change to through /dev/fev-fsnotify: an
+	  "invalidate everything" that expires entries and does not fail them,
+	  replies that were on their way while an entry was invalidated, and
+	  the requests such caching leaves over (FUSE_FEV_CACHE,
+	  FUSE_ATTR_NO_KEEP_CACHE and FUSE_ATTR_NO_SEC in
+	  include/uapi/linux/fuse.h).
